lm-sensors 3.1.1 was released 7 months ago, so I guess it's about time
to release 3.1.2. I know that none of the tickets we were supposed to
solve in this version have actually been, but the changelog is still
long enough that a new release would be very welcome.

Proposed schedule:
* SVN freeze: January 24th
* testing: January 25th to 31st
* release: February 1st

